        "created_at": "2016-01-16T06:24:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I sleeve my cards and store the hero cards with their decks which are also sleeved. The oversized cards fit into an iris photo case. All my heroes are in SotM box, villains in VotM box, vengeance villains and environments in Vengeance box. Store tokens and dice in the oversized areas in the Vengeance and VotM boxes. All of this then fits into an Army Transport bag along with Sentinel Tactics and box of minis on top, with the cases for the oversized cards of both games fitting into the front pockets of the bag. So everything i need for SotM is in one bag except for the poster maps for Tactics.</p><p>http://www.irisusainc.com/p-493-kp-pc.aspx</p>",
